riscv_mem_error_test.14605 - Check waves, Fetch error in ID stage, seeing a memory stall so
outstanding load or store in writeback stage, sees memory exception but should
clear the memory stall - Should not be an illegal cross bin. We have a fetch error but the (invalid) instruction data decodes as a load or store. The logic driving the stall signal looks at the raw decode logic so it's waiting for a request to start (that will never start as the request itsef is squashed because of the fetch error). Harmless as the exception clears out the ID stage. InstrCategoryFetchError should be removed from the illegal bins here.
